msgid "``PF_ECDH_CURVE_P521``"
msgstr "``PF_ECDH_CURVE_P521``"

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:137 5f2b04819c5a4d7b8e96512bca6cf86e
msgid ""
"Public keys are exchanged as PEM SubjectPublicKeyInfo strings. Parsed peer "
"keys are checked before use."
msgstr "公钥作为 PEM subjectPublicKeyInfo 字符串进行交换。使用前会检查已解析的对等密钥。"

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:160 0f40f41880b94e828bbd58ac631754a1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The higher-level ``pf_ecdh_seal`` and ``pf_ecdh_open`` APIs are recommended "
"for application payloads. They derive an AES-256-GCM key with HKDF-SHA256, "
"include a random salt and IV, and authenticate optional AAD."
msgstr ""
"建议将更高级别的 ``ss_ecdh_seal`` 和 ``ss_ecdh_open`` API 用于应用程序负载。他们使用 HKDF-SHA256 "
"派生 AES-256-GCM 密钥，包括随机盐和 IV，并验证可选的 AAD。"

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:164 84614363b3104ac4a44f044dad010eeb
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ``pf_ecdh_seal`` output format is:"
msgstr "``ss_ecdh_seal`` 输出格式为："

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:170 77967b230b95484a836884d1d717eab3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fixed overhead is ``PF_ECDH_SEAL_OVERHEAD`` (44 bytes). Empty plaintext "
"is allowed. A failed tag check returns ``PF_ERR_AUTH_FAILED`` and no "
"plaintext is returned."
msgstr ""
"固定开销为“SS_ECDH_SEAL_OVERHEAD”（44 "
"字节）。允许空明文。失败的标签检查返回``SS_ERR_AUTH_FAILED``并且不返回明文。"

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:175 1c226278e4b746a8b67358e6f6b12b25
msgid "Security Notes"
msgstr "安全说明"

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:177 22976e7f6a74484abe6856c1e38ff27d
msgid ""
"ECDH provides key agreement, but it does not authenticate public-key "
"ownership by itself. Public keys must be exchanged over an authenticated "
"channel or verified with an external signature/certificate mechanism."
msgstr "ECDH 提供密钥协商，但它本身并不验证公钥所有权。公钥必须通过经过身份验证的通道进行交换或使用外部签名/证书机制进行验证。"

#: ../../Crypto/Crypto.rst:181 532db57edd2f478f94bca8860aaead12
msgid ""
"Private key files may be protected with a passphrase. Applications should "
"restrict their file permissions and avoid logging passphrases, private keys,"
" or plaintext session keys."
msgstr "私钥文件可以用密码保护。应用程序应限制其文件权限并避免记录密码、私钥或纯文本会话密钥。"

